<h1>Production host integration</h1>

<p>This application demonstrates authenticated, private, durable IntentBlazor workspaces using authored offline output. No model connection or synthetic sign-in is installed.</p>
<p>Supply your application's real sign-in provider and current server-side account grants, then open <a href="/workspaces">your workspaces</a>.</p>
